% rebase('templates/skeleton.tpl', title=title)

<h1 class="mt-5">Video Caption Evaluation Study</h1>

<p class="mt-4">
    Thank you for participating in this study.
</p>

<p>
    In this experiment, you will watch a series of short videos without audio.
    After each video, you will be shown a generated textual description of its
    visual content.
</p>

<p>
    Your task is to evaluate <strong>how well the caption represents the visual
    content of the video</strong> using the following 5-point scale:
</p>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="card-body">
        <p class="mb-1"><strong>5 – Excellent</strong></p>
        <p class="mb-1"><strong>4 – Good</strong></p>
        <p class="mb-1"><strong>3 – Fair</strong></p>
        <p class="mb-1"><strong>2 – Poor</strong></p>
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>1 – Bad</strong></p>
    </div>
</div>

<p>
    Please watch each video carefully and evaluate each caption independently
    based only on what you observed in the video.
</p>

<p>
    Each video will appear four times during the evaluation, each time with a different generated caption. Please evaluate each video-caption pair independently in every trial.    
</p> 
 
<p> 
    Before the formal evaluation begins, you will complete a training session 
    to become familiar with the procedure. 
</p> 
 
<a class="btn btn-large btn-success" href="/questionnaire" id="start"> 
    Continue 
</a>

